%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorMargin": 30, "boxMargin": 5, "noteMargin": 5, "messageMargin": 25, "diagramMarginX": 20, "diagramMarginY": 10}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kasir
    participant C as CashierController
    participant S as InventoryService
    participant MS as MenuStockService
    participant DB as Database
    participant EV as StockUpdated Event

    K->>C: Buat pesanan baru
    C->>C: StoreOrderRequest: validasi stok
    C->>C: canFulfillOrder() pre-check
    
    C->>S: processSaleForOrder(order)
    S->>S: Cek idempotensi (sudah diproses?)
    
    S->>DB: DB::transaction()
    
    loop Setiap item pesanan
        S->>S: Menu punya resep?
        
        alt Menu dengan resep
            S->>DB: lockForUpdate() ingredient_batches
            S->>S: Urut batch via batch_mode (FEFO/FIFO/Custom)
            
            loop Setiap bahan dalam resep
                S->>DB: Kurangi quantity batch
                S->>DB: Buat StockMovement (immutable)
                S->>DB: Upsert DailyIngredientUsage
            end
            
        else Menu tanpa resep (MenuStock)
            S->>MS: deductMenuStockBatch()
            MS->>DB: lockForUpdate() menu_stock_batches
            MS->>MS: Urut batch via batch_mode
            MS->>DB: Kurangi quantity batch
            MS->>DB: Buat MenuStockMovement (immutable)
        end
    end

    S->>DB: DB::commit()
    S->>EV: broadcast(StockUpdated)
    EV->>K: Update stok real-time
    C->>K: Redirect ke detail pesanan
